WEBVTT

00:20.820 --> 00:24.640
Hey, where did all the other passengers go?

00:24.640 --> 00:25.790
They got off.

00:25.790 --> 00:27.080
Got…

00:27.080 --> 00:29.840
Now, it’s your turn.

00:29.840 --> 00:31.710
They’re all waiting for you.

00:42.930 --> 00:45.900
Ghost Cat

01:10.340 --> 01:14.670
The blue moon illuminated

01:14.720 --> 01:18.640
your wandering shadow.

01:19.260 --> 01:23.140
I could never tell you all I wanted to say.

01:23.140 --> 01:28.060
It was so very frustrating.

01:28.150 --> 01:31.940
I think about your faked smile,

01:32.530 --> 01:36.570
and forget all the hot tears we shed.

01:37.030 --> 01:39.240
What do these empty husks,

01:39.280 --> 01:45.080
those empty eyes of yours, reflect, my dear?

01:45.830 --> 01:50.290
The transient quarter moon

01:50.670 --> 01:52.460
hides in a rift in the clouds,

01:52.420 --> 01:54.840
as darkness seeps up from the ground.

01:54.880 --> 01:59.300
Tell me the truth, please.

01:59.640 --> 02:01.470
Are you so despondent

02:01.550 --> 02:05.890
that you still sit alone, sighing?

02:06.390 --> 02:08.890
Finale

02:10.970 --> 02:14.430
This train will never stop.

02:12.890 --> 02:14.430
I don’t care!

02:17.710 --> 02:20.520
Then, you’ll stay here—

02:19.750 --> 02:20.510
No! I won’t!

02:20.510 --> 02:22.050
No! I won’t!

02:24.170 --> 02:25.950
Do something about this.

02:25.950 --> 02:28.380
Surely you can help!

02:32.010 --> 02:35.930
How did it come to this?

02:35.930 --> 02:39.440
I just wanted to help her.

02:39.440 --> 02:42.190
Help Setsuko-san?

02:42.190 --> 02:43.230
That’s right!

02:43.230 --> 02:45.530
I felt so sorry that she’d been killed!

02:53.780 --> 02:55.740
Ichikawa.

03:01.700 --> 03:04.530
Moria-san.

03:05.630 --> 03:08.410
You’re terrible.

03:17.790 --> 03:19.300
Show him. Show him.

03:19.300 --> 03:20.010
Show him. Show him.

03:20.690 --> 03:22.100
Show him.

03:25.690 --> 03:26.310
This is…

03:27.020 --> 03:27.730
Show him.

03:27.730 --> 03:29.440
Are the cats doing this?

03:29.440 --> 03:30.060
Show him.

03:30.060 --> 03:32.780
Stop!

03:32.780 --> 03:35.780
Memories are tied to a single place.

03:36.220 --> 03:39.020
Memory brings about Regret,

03:39.040 --> 03:43.540
and it is through Regret that fates intertwine.

03:46.780 --> 03:51.080
All is turned upside-down.

03:52.470 --> 03:54.180
It’s all your fault!

03:54.180 --> 03:58.970
With Form, Truth and Regret, all can be revealed.

04:02.230 --> 04:04.010
Will you show me

04:05.190 --> 04:06.100
the reason for

04:07.440 --> 04:08.510
your Regret?

04:13.270 --> 04:14.730
Huh? What was that?

04:15.490 --> 04:17.580
Mayor Fukuda is corrupt!

04:18.980 --> 04:20.320
Morning News

04:20.320 --> 04:22.070
I have proof.

04:25.790 --> 04:26.620
Let’s hear what you have to say.

04:29.500 --> 04:30.910
Moria-san?

04:31.460 --> 04:32.670
Is this information reliable?

04:32.670 --> 04:34.300
Of course!

04:34.300 --> 04:38.100
I have it on good authority that
the mayor is meeting with executives

04:38.100 --> 04:40.350
from the railroad company on a regular basis.

04:42.020 --> 04:44.350
Well, there’s nothing illegal about that.

04:44.350 --> 04:47.040
But don’t you think it unlikely

04:45.110 --> 04:48.930
I’m sorry, Ichikawa, but we’re not a tabloid.

04:47.060 --> 04:48.930
that they’re just making small talk?

04:49.820 --> 04:53.070
That’s not enough information for a proper article.

04:53.070 --> 04:56.660
I think you’re just jealous!

04:56.640 --> 04:58.770
Jealous of who?

04:58.770 --> 05:02.310
You’re jealous of me, Moria-san.

05:02.330 --> 05:03.450
Ridiculous!

05:03.450 --> 05:05.960
You’re jealous that I got such a huge story.

05:05.960 --> 05:08.130
It’s not a story at all!

05:08.130 --> 05:09.910
There’s nothing to be jealous about.

05:10.460 --> 05:11.990
We can’t publish it.

05:13.090 --> 05:15.750
Looks like it was a mistake to send you into the field.

05:16.550 --> 05:20.470
You bit off more than you could chew.
I’m putting you back on the advice column.

05:20.470 --> 05:21.470
You can’t!

05:21.470 --> 05:23.050
I’m not giving up on this!

05:23.580 --> 05:27.330
I’ll get to the bottom of this. Mark my words!

05:25.210 --> 05:27.330
Don’t get me wrong, Ichikawa.

05:27.350 --> 05:29.150
I think you’re a great—

05:29.010 --> 05:30.220
Kisshou Hotel

05:30.440 --> 05:34.030
Whoo, yeah! Here it comes!

05:39.410 --> 05:39.980
What’s this?

05:40.660 --> 05:42.480
A woman peeping at me?

05:44.540 --> 05:46.290
I won’t…

05:46.290 --> 05:47.360
I won’t let them beat me.

05:53.340 --> 05:55.210
Yes, thank you.

05:55.210 --> 05:56.840
Thank you. Thank you.

05:56.840 --> 05:57.830
Yes, indeed, I look forward to it.

05:58.580 --> 05:59.220
I see.

06:10.590 --> 06:12.690
Is this still not enough?

06:17.990 --> 06:20.520
Just as I thought.

06:20.520 --> 06:24.120
I knew you could do it.

06:24.120 --> 06:25.490
I’m sorry for being so hard on you.

06:25.490 --> 06:27.650
Forgive me, Ichikawa.

06:27.650 --> 06:30.700
That’s right! I knew she had it in her!

06:31.250 --> 06:32.490
That’s why I was so hard on her!

06:37.510 --> 06:38.710
When did it happen?

06:38.710 --> 06:39.620
Last night.

06:40.550 --> 06:42.430
And you developed the shots yourself?

06:42.430 --> 06:44.600
Yes.

06:44.600 --> 06:45.630
Where is the film?

06:45.630 --> 06:46.710
In here.

06:46.710 --> 06:48.050
Hey,

06:48.050 --> 06:49.190
let’s go out.

06:49.190 --> 06:50.060
But—

06:50.060 --> 06:52.150
This is a huge scoop.

06:52.150 --> 06:54.190
We can’t let afford to let anyone know about this.

06:54.730 --> 06:56.650
Not even one of our co-workers.

06:57.430 --> 06:58.810
CanCan Café

07:02.280 --> 07:05.150
Here’s the mayor with Touto Railways’ Board of Directors.

07:05.150 --> 07:08.540
Here he is with Nohinbashi Construction.

07:08.540 --> 07:10.710
They met at Kisshou Hotel in Kajima.

07:12.420 --> 07:17.090
The mayor recently passed a city
ordinance at the rail company’s request.

07:17.090 --> 07:19.880
I believe he received a considerable bribe in return.

07:19.880 --> 07:20.790
Where does he bank?

07:20.790 --> 07:22.040
The Ichi’i Bank.

07:23.340 --> 07:25.760
The mayor’s uncle is its president.

07:25.760 --> 07:27.470
I see.

07:27.470 --> 07:30.520
This is more than enough information to move on.

07:30.520 --> 07:31.810
This is front page material.

07:32.270 --> 07:35.900
Have it on my desk tomorrow
night. We’ll run it the next morning.

07:35.900 --> 07:38.150
It’s not much time, but can you make it?

07:39.610 --> 07:42.570
You want me to write the whole article?

07:42.950 --> 07:43.950
Of course!

07:43.950 --> 07:46.910
You did all the work, so you should reap the benefits.

07:58.750 --> 08:00.670
Thank you so much!

08:01.320 --> 08:05.620
I misjudged you, Moria-san.

08:06.330 --> 08:11.620
I was sure you thought of me as a weak, worthless woman,

08:11.640 --> 08:15.150
and that only a man could become a real reporter.

08:15.150 --> 08:16.360
I just thought that…

08:16.360 --> 08:17.980
You couldn’t be more wrong!

08:18.650 --> 08:20.400
Thank goodness!

08:20.400 --> 08:25.450
I’m finally a real newswoman.

08:25.450 --> 08:29.150
Do you know where Hichiriki Zaka’s Konata Inn is?

08:30.790 --> 08:32.330
Write it there.

08:32.330 --> 08:33.370
To prevent any leaks?

08:33.370 --> 08:34.360
That’s right.

08:34.360 --> 08:36.530
We can’t let anyone know about this article.

08:36.530 --> 08:38.780
I’ll put it on the page myself.

08:38.780 --> 08:40.050
Understand?

08:40.050 --> 08:40.580
Yes!

08:43.380 --> 08:46.340
Yes, the very same.

08:46.340 --> 08:50.760
Yes. Actually, I have a proposition for you.

08:50.760 --> 08:53.840
No, it’s not very pleasant at all.

08:55.310 --> 08:59.730
No reason to meet anywhere else, is there?

08:59.730 --> 09:01.980
I’ll come to you.

09:10.680 --> 09:12.980
Her Regret is close.

09:13.000 --> 09:14.120
Her Regret is close.

09:28.180 --> 09:31.470
You promise to help me?

09:31.470 --> 09:34.130
Please, I’m begging you. I want to be famous!

09:35.020 --> 09:38.760
I couldn’t stand to rot away here the rest of my life!

09:43.810 --> 09:45.020
City Hall

09:48.700 --> 09:50.560
Are you the man I spoke to?

09:51.240 --> 09:55.900
I actually had fun last night, for once.

09:56.400 --> 09:57.650
Konata Inn

09:57.650 --> 09:59.820
Hello, Konata Inn.

10:12.340 --> 10:14.300
You’ve got to be kidding me.

10:52.270 --> 10:55.440
You have a telephone call.

10:55.440 --> 10:56.820
All right.

11:01.090 --> 11:02.860
Ah.

11:08.640 --> 11:11.140
Working here,

11:17.630 --> 11:20.360
Pitiful, isn’t it?

11:21.210 --> 11:23.320
I was so glad.

11:23.320 --> 11:25.700
I’m different from that loser.

11:26.430 --> 11:28.410
I’m a newswoman.

11:29.060 --> 11:31.810
This is Ichikawa.

11:31.810 --> 11:32.290
Huh?

11:33.190 --> 11:34.540
Why is that?

11:40.440 --> 11:42.360
Yes, I understand.

11:44.850 --> 11:46.260
CanCan Café

11:49.390 --> 11:51.040
It’s true!

11:51.040 --> 11:54.290
People have asked me if I wanted to be a singer.

11:55.480 --> 11:57.980
Aw, I remember that.

12:01.960 --> 12:05.620
I wonder what happened.

12:22.230 --> 12:23.130
Moria-san!

12:24.030 --> 12:26.740
You’re sure you weren’t followed?

12:26.740 --> 12:28.370
Yes.

12:28.370 --> 12:29.930
What’s wrong, Moria-san?

12:30.700 --> 12:33.060
Why do you look so afraid?

12:33.620 --> 12:36.810
We’re in danger.

12:36.810 --> 12:39.040
Oh, poppycock.

12:39.040 --> 12:41.530
It’s not as though we’ll be killed or anything.

12:46.620 --> 12:51.540
I just went to see if she was all right!

12:51.540 --> 12:54.100
There’s no hurry.

12:59.520 --> 13:01.270
Where’s the article?

13:01.270 --> 13:02.670
I have it with me.

13:03.570 --> 13:05.570
Are you going to read it here?

13:05.570 --> 13:06.990
Yes.

13:10.320 --> 13:10.970
What’s wrong?

13:12.680 --> 13:14.060
Nothing.

13:15.310 --> 13:17.890
What are you doing?

13:15.960 --> 13:18.880
I can’t let this out.

13:17.910 --> 13:18.920
Why not?

13:18.920 --> 13:19.830
Just following orders.

13:19.830 --> 13:20.320
Whose orders?

13:21.790 --> 13:22.860
Masao!

13:24.420 --> 13:26.410
Masao, are you up?

13:26.880 --> 13:29.110
Moria-san, you can’t do this!

13:29.110 --> 13:30.660
You have no right to do this!

13:30.680 --> 13:31.850
I’ll tell our superiors!

13:31.850 --> 13:34.720
No use. I’ve already spoken to them.

13:34.720 --> 13:35.410
You’re lying!

13:35.410 --> 13:36.500
No, I’m not.

13:36.520 --> 13:38.350
You planned this from the beginning!

13:38.350 --> 13:40.540
You were always going to steal my—

13:39.400 --> 13:42.170
I’m sorry. I had to do it.

13:40.560 --> 13:42.170
You coward! You snake!

13:43.360 --> 13:46.090
You planned it from the beginning?

13:46.090 --> 13:47.860
I’ll talk her out of it.

13:47.860 --> 13:48.720
How?

13:48.720 --> 13:53.330
I’ll tell the Chief Editor! I’ll get you fired!

13:57.770 --> 14:01.880
This could be quite a problem.

14:01.840 --> 14:04.780
Well, it’s not really my concern.

14:01.860 --> 14:04.780
At any rate, I’ll leave it to you.

14:04.780 --> 14:08.240
You think I’m jealous of you?

14:06.610 --> 14:08.240
Damn you!

14:08.240 --> 14:11.780
Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!

14:08.260 --> 14:09.030
Don’t make me laugh.

14:09.030 --> 14:11.780
I wouldn’t do this over such petty concerns.

14:11.780 --> 14:17.160
You’re a woman to the end, never
able to catch on when it really counts.

14:12.950 --> 14:17.160
Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!

14:18.350 --> 14:24.360
I was watching her from a much higher position.

14:24.900 --> 14:26.340
What do you mean?

14:26.920 --> 14:30.740
You must not hesitate in executing this order.

14:30.740 --> 14:31.950
You understand?

14:31.950 --> 14:34.620
We can’t have this turning into a scandal.

14:35.740 --> 14:37.730
You’re working for Mayor Fukuda?

14:37.730 --> 14:41.400
How dare you? How dare you?

14:37.730 --> 14:42.850
Yes, you women are so blind.

14:41.400 --> 14:42.850
How dare you?

14:42.870 --> 14:44.780
You have no ability to read a situation.

14:44.210 --> 14:44.780
I’ll kill you!

14:45.320 --> 14:48.150
You never wanted to print the article.

14:48.170 --> 14:49.530
You never wanted to print the article.

14:49.530 --> 14:54.200
You’ll take orders from me now.

14:58.100 --> 15:00.790
I’ll have it printed somewhere else!

15:00.790 --> 15:04.150
I still have the proof!

15:04.150 --> 15:05.440
I’ve fooled you!

15:05.440 --> 15:06.050
Where is it?

15:06.050 --> 15:07.610
Give it to me!

15:07.610 --> 15:09.340
I’ll never give it up!

15:13.150 --> 15:18.450
This is the only time I really feel alive.

15:18.450 --> 15:20.910
The people won’t allow this!

15:26.330 --> 15:28.090
Stop it! Stop it!

15:28.090 --> 15:29.360
That old hag…

15:31.780 --> 15:34.030
I wish she would just die!

15:49.900 --> 15:52.430
You really are a stupid woman.

15:52.430 --> 15:54.510
I gave you fair warning.

15:55.030 --> 15:56.110
You made me—

15:55.180 --> 15:56.090
Made me kill you?

15:56.120 --> 15:57.350
Made me kill you?

16:15.050 --> 16:16.840
So sorry.

16:16.840 --> 16:17.740
It’s nothing.

16:21.540 --> 16:26.880
A woman reporter bit off more than she could chew,
and committed suicide after having her dreams shattered.

16:37.800 --> 16:40.490
It hurts. It hurts.

16:40.490 --> 16:42.410
I can’t move.

16:43.750 --> 16:45.810
No! No, it can’t be!

16:46.710 --> 16:48.630
No!

16:48.630 --> 16:49.940
Please, notice me!

16:53.250 --> 16:56.030
Don’t hit me! You have to notice me!

17:01.830 --> 17:04.040
I’ll never forgive you.

17:04.810 --> 17:06.670
I’ll never forgive you.

17:11.110 --> 17:13.840
No!

17:21.180 --> 17:23.910
She’s not even good enough for the back page.

17:25.480 --> 17:27.520
I want to be an actress.

17:27.520 --> 17:28.690
Here’s your payment.

17:29.210 --> 17:32.980
Yeah, this is a suicide. A suicide, I’m sure.

17:36.950 --> 17:38.950
Shut up!

17:45.500 --> 17:47.210
I’ll never forgive you.

17:47.230 --> 17:48.390
I’ll never forgive you.

17:48.920 --> 17:52.090
Ayakashi reside in a host,

17:53.020 --> 17:54.480
and humans reside in the physical plane.

17:55.530 --> 18:00.140
A Mononoke is formed with an Ayakashi as its host,

18:00.780 --> 18:04.180
and fed by the fates of men.

18:04.180 --> 18:09.810
However, when a Mononoke comes into the human plane,

18:09.810 --> 18:12.060
it must be killed.

18:12.080 --> 18:13.110
it must be killed.

18:15.250 --> 18:17.260
This is

18:21.570 --> 18:22.800
a Ghost Cat.

18:26.450 --> 18:28.080
I will cleanse this world.

18:28.080 --> 18:29.830
I will cleanse this world.

18:29.850 --> 18:31.440
I will cleanse this world.

18:31.440 --> 18:34.610
The Mononoke must be killed.

18:36.400 --> 18:38.340
Release.

19:21.990 --> 19:23.320
A dream?

19:26.030 --> 19:30.020
I’d like to embark on the second stage as soon as possible.

19:28.280 --> 19:30.020
We’re safe?

19:32.000 --> 19:33.710
Are we safe?

19:37.110 --> 19:39.880
It was just a nightmare.

19:39.880 --> 19:40.950
That’s unlike me.

19:41.800 --> 19:44.510
I’m sorry, Ichikawa.

19:44.510 --> 19:46.580
I had no choice.

20:06.050 --> 20:08.390
I’ll never forgive you.

20:13.400 --> 20:20.900
Without you, I just can’t smile.

20:22.030 --> 20:31.960
I walk this banal town,

20:31.960 --> 20:38.040
feeling such intense emotions.

20:38.590 --> 20:44.430
I know that if I could treasure them and live on,

20:44.510 --> 20:53.730
I would need nothing else.

20:54.310 --> 20:57.270
Afterword

20:54.390 --> 21:01.900
The summer flowers that bloomed in the sky

21:01.900 --> 21:08.200
Come falling down, dancing in the wind.

21:08.280 --> 21:11.540
I can barely recall the night sky

21:11.540 --> 21:14.830
where they all came tumbling down,

21:14.830 --> 21:25.680
so what I can still recall is all the more precious.

21:32.350 --> 21:34.270
Men are born into this world,

21:35.430 --> 21:38.270
Ayakashi simply come into being.

21:38.270 --> 21:42.780
If birth and being are accompanied by Truth and Regret,

21:42.780 --> 21:44.820
they gain a Form.

21:44.820 --> 21:49.370
If they gain a Form, they become a
Mononoke, which should not exist.

21:49.370 --> 21:52.160
We cannot eradicate the Mononoke.

21:52.160 --> 21:57.330
However, we can purify them, and put them to rest.

21:57.330 --> 22:01.960
And so, there must be a sword,
and hands in which it might rest.

22:01.960 --> 22:08.550
My friends, let me ask you of your Truth and Regret.

22:10.130 --> 22:13.220
So long as Mononoke roam this world…

22:13.220 --> 22:14.180
So long as Mononoke roam this world…

22:19.890 --> 22:21.230
Miss?

22:22.190 --> 22:23.820
I’m coming!

22:25.740 --> 22:29.910
Thank you,                     everyone.
